    "message": "Fix terminal prompt duplication when resizing the terminal panel\n\nThe terminal resize debouncer sent a PTY resize on every layout event even\nwhen the grid dimensions did not change, triggering SIGWINCH storms that\nmade shells redraw the prompt repeatedly. Additionally, the horizontal\nresize debounce was too short (100ms) for shells such as zsh to finish\ntheir prompt redraw, so consecutive resizes were processed with a stale\nterminal width and duplicated the prompt line.\n\nSkip resizes whose dimensions are unchanged and debounce horizontal\nresizes for 300ms instead of 100ms.\n\nFixes microsoft/vscode#329946",
