    "message": "fix: gate hidden-terminal idle callbacks per axis to prevent redundant resizes\n\nApply the same per-axis dimension checks to the hidden terminal path\nthat the visible path already uses. Only queue idle callbacks for axes\nwhose dimensions actually changed, and clear pending jobs for axes that\nmatch the current grid, preventing redundant PTY resizes.",
